@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### =====================================================
### 00. Sanity — Create Product TANPA token
### EKSPEKTASI: status 401 atau 403
### =====================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Tanpa Auth",
  "origin": "Test"
}

### =====================================================
### SETUP AKUN
### =====================================================

### 01. Register Artisan 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/artisan/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pengrajin Satu",
  "username": "qa_artisan1",
  "password": "rahasia123"
}

### 02. Register Artisan 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/artisan/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pengrajin Dua",
  "username": "qa_artisan2",
  "password": "rahasia123"
}

### 03. Login Artisan 1
# @name loginArtisan1
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/artisan/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "qa_artisan1",
  "password": "rahasia123"
}

### 04. Login Artisan 2
# @name loginArtisan2
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/artisan/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "qa_artisan2",
  "password": "rahasia123"
}

### 05. Register Owner 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/owner/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pembeli Satu",
  "username": "qa_owner1",
  "password": "rahasia123"
}

### 06. Register Owner 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/owner/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pembeli Dua",
  "username": "qa_owner2",
  "password": "rahasia123"
}

### 07. Login Owner 1
# @name loginOwner1
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/owner/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "qa_owner1",
  "password": "rahasia123"
}

### 08. Login Owner 2
# @name loginOwner2
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/owner/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "qa_owner2",
  "password": "rahasia123"
}

### =====================================================
### PRODUCT & KEAMANAN KRITIS
### =====================================================

### 09. Create Product (Artisan 1) — EKSPEKTASI: status 201
# @name createProduct
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginArtisan1.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

{
  "name": "Batik QA Test",
  "origin": "Jogja",
  "description": "Produk buat full testing"
}

### 10. [CRITICAL] Artisan 2 coba edit produk milik Artisan 1
### EKSPEKTASI: status 401 atau 403. Kalau malah 200, ini bug otorisasi serius — STOP.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/products/edit/{{createProduct.response.body.$.data.qr_code}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginArtisan2.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

{
  "name": "DIUBAH PAKSA OLEH ARTISAN LAIN"
}

### 11. Sanity — Artisan 1 edit produknya sendiri
### EKSPEKTASI: status 200 (harus berhasil untuk pemilik asli)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/products/edit/{{createProduct.response.body.$.data.qr_code}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginArtisan1.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

{
  "description": "Deskripsi diperbarui oleh pemilik asli"
}

### 12. Scan produk publik (tanpa auth) — EKSPEKTASI: status 200, data lengkap muncul
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/scan/{{createProduct.response.body.$.data.qr_code}}

### 13. Claim dengan claim_code SALAH
### EKSPEKTASI: status 400 atau 403, ditolak
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/claim/{{createProduct.response.body.$.data.qr_code}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner1.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

{
  "claim_code": "kode-ngasal-salah"
}

### 14. Claim dengan claim_code BENAR (Owner 1) — EKSPEKTASI: status 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/claim/{{createProduct.response.body.$.data.qr_code}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner1.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

{
  "claim_code": "{{createProduct.response.body.$.data.claim_code}}"
}

### 15. Claim ULANG oleh Owner 2 (produk sudah diklaim Owner 1)
### EKSPEKTASI: status 409
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/claim/{{createProduct.response.body.$.data.qr_code}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner2.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

{
  "claim_code": "{{createProduct.response.body.$.data.claim_code}}"
}

### =====================================================
### TRANSFER 2-SISI
### =====================================================

### 16. Transfer Initiate — Owner 1 ke Owner 2 — EKSPEKTASI: status 200/201, status="pending"
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/transfer/{{createProduct.response.body.$.data.qr_code}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner1.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

{
  "target_username": "qa_owner2"
}

### 17. Owner 2 cek pending transfer
### CATAT nilai "id" dari response ini, dipakai manual di langkah #18
GET {{baseUrl}}/transfers/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner2.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### 18. [CRITICAL] Owner 2 REJECT transfer
### Ganti REPLACE_ID_DARI_LANGKAH_17 dengan angka id dari respons #17 di atas
### EKSPEKTASI: status 200, status transfer jadi "rejected"
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/transfers/reject
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner2.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

{
  "transfer_id": REPLACE_ID_DARI_LANGKAH_17
}

### 19. [CRITICAL] Cek produk setelah reject
### EKSPEKTASI: owner/owner_name di response ini HARUS MASIH "Pembeli Satu",
### BUKAN "Pembeli Dua". Kalau ternyata sudah pindah ke Pembeli Dua padahal
### baru saja di-reject, itu bug — reject seharusnya TIDAK memindahkan kepemilikan.
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/scan/{{createProduct.response.body.$.data.qr_code}}

### 20. Transfer Initiate LAGI — buat test alur Accept
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/transfer/{{createProduct.response.body.$.data.qr_code}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner1.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

{
  "target_username": "qa_owner2"
}

### 21. Owner 2 cek pending lagi
### CATAT nilai "id" baru dari response ini, dipakai manual di langkah #22
GET {{baseUrl}}/transfers/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner2.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### 22. Owner 2 ACCEPT transfer
### Ganti REPLACE_ID_DARI_LANGKAH_21 dengan angka id dari respons #21 di atas
### EKSPEKTASI: status 200, status transfer jadi "accepted"
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/transfers/accept
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner2.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

{
  "transfer_id": REPLACE_ID_DARI_LANGKAH_21
}

### 23. Cek produk setelah accept
### EKSPEKTASI: owner/owner_name SEKARANG harus "Pembeli Dua"
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/scan/{{createProduct.response.body.$.data.qr_code}}

### 24. Riwayat kepemilikan lengkap
### EKSPEKTASI: 3 entri — klaim awal (null→Owner1), reject (Owner1→Owner2,
### status rejected), accept (Owner1→Owner2, status accepted)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/history/{{createProduct.response.body.$.data.qr_code}}

### 25. Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats

### =====================================================
### YANG GAK BISA DITES LEWAT SINI — TES TERPISAH
### =====================================================
# 1. CORS — buka DevTools browser, fetch API ini dari origin lain, harus
#    muncul error CORS di console. REST Client bukan browser, gak enforce CORS.
# 2. Upload gambar — coba lewat form beneran di frontend (drag & drop foto).
# 3. PWA — buka web di HP, coba "Add to Home Screen", cek behavior offline.
